		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Small, ethereal worm that consumes spellcaster's lore.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 9, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +0 (eat thoughts), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Eat Thoughts</strong>. If spellcaster, target loses the ability to cast a random spell, regaining spells after resting. If non- spellcaster, target takes 1 INT damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ethereal Body</strong>. Takes half damage from non-magical attacks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ethereal Passage</strong>. When moving, can shift into the Ethereal plane, passing through solid material. Shifts back into physical world at end of movement.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
